      "en": "The range of the mountains is his pasture. He searches after every green thing.",
      "ko": "초장이 된 산으로 두루 다니며 여러 가지 푸른 것을 찾느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "aeb2558189b9278822e0c463ec7144baf458521d5404a745fe222cc156dc97b1",
      "translation_text_hash": "eef2c852796c45f61eccf9743d9dce9d2a2af6689ac1a95c011ac2cc7801f7f0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "초장이 된 산으로 두루 다니며 여러 가지 푸른 것을 찾느니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "eef2c852796c45f61eccf9743d9dce9d2a2af6689ac1a95c011ac2cc7801f7f0"
      ]
