      "en": "“Will the wild ox be content to serve you? Or will he stay by your feeding trough?",
      "ko": "들 소가 어찌 즐겨 네게 복종하며 네 외양간에 머물겠느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "2e2ed5515005abe3d41957ad33ce1e60e99d7149383a47358c4bda4f099a5905",
      "translation_text_hash": "7207bd9e22a745619db9441e3c118e6933e5be77f91215d65c695b27e245cdaa",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
