      "en": "She deals harshly with her young ones, as if they were not hers. Though her labor is in vain, she is without fear,",
      "ko": "그 새끼에게 무정함이 제 새끼가 아닌 것처럼 하며 그 구로한 것이 헛되게 될찌라도 괘념치 아니하나니",
      "source_text_hash": "a9980511b0183cab5a8c49421024fd406959f9e267af0f610d14c1343334e2f3",
      "translation_text_hash": "3dd55ef90a7a6a15f0ef60946c28b19cacda527b6143b4ade1b673222447975c",
